  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 adds shared IModelServer and IModelMetricsProvider contracts, server information and observed capabilities while retaining concrete Vllm APIs. Common operations validate bounded responses, preserve unknown model state and metric labels, and omit raw failure payloads; legacy diagnostic fields remain available. Body reads honor caller cancellation. Live checks used vLLM 0.30.0 with a small Qwen model; see full notes for coverage and limits. Lifecycle/download remain unsupported. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v110",
